# I18N & Content

- **No hardcoded user-facing strings** in components — use the i18n layer (or a central `messages.ts` constant if i18n is not yet set up)
- **RTL-safe layouts**: use Tailwind `start`/`end` instead of `left`/`right` where applicable
- **Date/number formatting** via `Intl.*` APIs, never manual string concatenation
